      "message": "* **Issue:** The file is becoming heavily fragmented with \\#if defined(CONFIG\\_CPU\\_CORTEX\\_M33) and \\#else blocks inside function bodies (e.g., mpu\\_enable, mpu\\_lock\\_rollback).  \n* **Suggestion:** To improve maintainability, consider abstracting the architecture-specific MPU register manipulations into static inline helper functions. For example:\n\n```c\nstatic inline void mpu_arch_enable_region_by_id(int region_id) {\n#if defined(CONFIG_CPU_CORTEX_M33)\n    MPU-\u003eRNR \u003d region_id;\n    MPU-\u003eRLAR |\u003d MPU_RLAR_EN_Msk;\n#else\n    MPU-\u003eRNR \u003d region_id;\n    MPU-\u003eRASR |\u003d MPU_RASR_ENABLE_Msk;\n#endif\n}\n```",
